<title>POLAND: Budimex signs $5.8 mln contract.</title>
<headline>Budimex signs $5.8 mln contract.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish construction firm Budimex SA said on Monday it had signed a $5.8 million contract with Black and Veatch Poland Ltd to build an electronic car part plant in the south-eastern city of Mielec.</p>
<p>It said in a statement the construction was due to start on June 25 and be completed on March 15, 1998.</p>
<p>Budimex said it had also signed two contracts, worth a total of 2.14 million marks, to carry out construction works for the German embassy in Moscow. The contracts are to be completed by June 1998. -- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
